_schema-version: "3.3"
ID: procurement-core-qa
extends: procurement-core
description: "QA-environment overrides - see mtaext-dev.mtaext's comment for why this ID must be unique from the base MTA's own ID (procurement-core) and from every other environment's own extension ID (procurement-core-dev, procurement-core-prod)."

resources:
